{"id": "EUVD-2026-104916", "enisaUuid": "996071f7-dc26-3f58-889e-1276974352ac", "description": "OpenCATS before 0.10.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in ajax/testEmailSettings.php that allows any authenticated user to send mail through the configured SMTP relay. Read-level users can supply testEmailAddress and fromAddress parameters to send the fixed test message to any recipient with a spoofed From address.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T10:41:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T13:27:10", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/issues/720", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/commit/aa3b414c3672f5010ca26c44192aa8e72d3735bd", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/releases/tag/v0.10.0", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/blob/5781f41814f09493c7ce05b9251b5e09c1aff0cd/ajax/testEmailSettings.php", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/opencats-before-0.10.0-missing-authorization-via-ajax-testemailsettings-php"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112784", "GHSA-pxhw-9vc5-hmj2"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "270afb10-626c-371a-8219-7c13fd94bb18", "product": {"name": "OpenCATS", "vendor": {"name": "opencats"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9434805f-b07b-3c41-977a-892e9f6836ae", "vendor": {"name": "opencats"}}], "isExploited": false}